sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户/Agent
    participant H as Claude Hook
    participant T as tracker.py
    participant S as JSON state.json
    participant P as uploader.py
    participant C as Spring Controller
    participant V as Telemetry Service
    participant DB as MySQL

    U->>H: prompt / Skill / tool / SessionEnd
    H->>T: JSON hook payload
    T->>S: workflow upsert / invocation fold / revision++
    T-->>P: 提交后异步启动
    P->>S: collect(upload_status=pending)
    P->>C: POST report(batch)
    C->>V: 参数、隐私、状态、revision 校验
    V->>DB: workflow upsert
    V->>DB: invocation upsert
    DB-->>V: commit
    V-->>C: accepted IDs / rejected
    C-->>P: ACK
    P->>S: 仅按 id + revision 标记 upload_status=uploaded
